{"type":"message_start","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The SQLite billing migration in `<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/077-086-sql-migration-preflight-rollback-atomic-a01-r02/hb-work/atomic/gpt-5.4/oc-bench-v2-086-sql-migration-preflight-rollback-gpt-5.4-20260831-174336-3f751e1e/workspace/in/billingdb/migration.sql` is unsafe and incomplete.\n\nRead `<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/077-086-sql-migration-preflight-rollback-atomic-a01-r02/hb-work/atomic/gpt-5.4/oc-bench-v2-086-sql-migration-preflight-rollback-gpt-5.4-20260831-174336-3f751e1e/workspace/in/billingdb/migration_policy.md`, then repair the migration package.\n\nYour job:\n- Edit `<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/077-086-sql-migration-preflight-rollback-atomic-a01-r02/hb-work/atomic/gpt-5.4/oc-bench-v2-086-sql-migration-preflight-rollback-gpt-5.4-20260831-174336-3f751e1e/workspace/in/billingdb/migration.sql`.\n- Create `<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/077-086-sql-migration-preflight-rollback-atomic-a01-r02/hb-work/atomic/gpt-5.4/oc-bench-v2-086-sql-migration-preflight-rollback-gpt-5.4-20260831-174336-3f751e1e/workspace/in/billingdb/preflight_report.md`.\n- Create `<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/077-086-sql-migration-preflight-rollback-atomic-a01-r02/hb-work/atomic/gpt-5.4/oc-bench-v2-086-sql-migration-preflight-rollback-gpt-5.4-20260831-174336-3f751e1e/workspace/in/billingdb/rollback.sql`.\n- Create `<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/077-086-sql-migration-preflight-rollback-atomic-a01-r02/hb-work/atomic/gpt-5.4/oc-bench-v2-086-sql-migration-preflight-rollback-gpt-5.4-20260831-174336-3f751e1e/workspace/in/billingdb/postcheck.sql`.\n- Create `<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/077-086-sql-migration-preflight-rollback-atomic-a01-r02/hb-work/atomic/gpt-5.4/oc-bench-v2-086-sql-migration-preflight-rollback-gpt-5.4-20260831-174336-3f751e1e/workspace/in/billingdb/migration_report.md`.\n\nRequired behavior:\n- Preserve all invoices and payments from `schema.sql`.\n- Add non-null `status` to invoices with default `open`.\n- Preserve historical invoice `created_at`.\n- Preserve orphan payments by moving them to `payment_orphans` before enforcing referential safety.\n- Enforce future `payments.invoice_id` references to valid invoices.\n- The migration must run inside an explicit transaction.\n- The migration must be idempotent: running it a second time must not duplicate or corrupt data.\n- Rollback must execute after the migration and restore the old table shape: `invoices(id, customer_id, total_cents, created_at)` and `payments(id, invoice_id, amount_cents, created_at)`.\n\nConstraints:\n- Do not modify `schema.sql` or `migration_policy.md`.\n- Do not delete orphan payment `p4`; preserve it in `payment_orphans`.\n- Do not disable foreign keys without restoring them.\n- Do not hard-code a solution that only works by deleting existing rows.\n- Do not use external services or non-SQLite features.\n"}],"timestamp":1788212621615}}
