ault `open`.\n- Preserve historical invoice `created_at`.\n- Preserve orphan payments by moving them to `payment_orphans` before enforcing referential safety.\n- Enforce future `payments.invoice_id` references to valid invoices.\n- The migration must run inside an explicit transaction.\n- The migration must be idempotent: running it a second time must not duplicate or corrupt data.\n- Rollback must execute after the migration and restore the old table shape: `invoices(id, customer_id, total_cents, created_at)` and `payments(id, invoice_id, amount_cents, created_at)`.\n\nConstraints:\n- Do not modify `schema.sql` or `migration_policy.md`.\n- Do not delete orphan payment `p4`; preserve it in `payment_orphans`.\n- Do not disable foreign keys without restoring them.\n- Do not hard-code a solution that only works by deleting existing rows.\n- Do not use external services or non-SQLite features.\n"}],"timestamp":1788212621615},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Planning multi-file inspection**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_08ed940ee6463d54016a95f59016e487d285703f74d52fc2bb\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"<PROVIDER_ENCRYPTED_PAYLOAD_REDACTED>\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Planning multi-file inspection**\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_EJcg0zWTJgTWLHqQFJ0eOAcc|fc_08ed940ee6463d54016a95f59ad0bc87d29af3afec1dbe9cb1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/077-086-sql-migration-preflight-rollback-atomic-a01-r02/hb-work/atomic/gpt-5.4/oc-bench-v2-086-sql-migration-preflight-rollback-gpt-5.4-20260831-174336-3f751e1e/workspace/in/billingdb/migration_policy.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_aHp2PtaKNCya6hM48Sm2VQR2|fc_08ed940ee6463d54016a95f59ad0d487d2a440fc7c446a45fd","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/077-086-sql-migration-preflight-rollback-atomic-a01-r02/hb-work/atomic/gpt-5.4/oc-bench-v2-086-sql-migration-preflight-rollback-